{"id":"n37903-2-8","stage":2,"title":"꿇다 · 留级","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37903-2-8-1","ko":"민준이는 우리보다 일 년 후배인데 나이는 같대.","zh":"敏俊比我们低一届，不过听说年龄一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이는","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"우리보다","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일","meaning":"一","explanation":"일：一","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31523","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"년","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"후배인데","meaning":"学弟，学妹，师弟，师妹，后辈","explanation":"후배：学弟，学妹，师弟，师妹，后辈；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"후배","audio":"/audio/d1877a494d990fd1bd03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73247","senseId":"2","lemma":"후배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나이는","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같대.","meaning":"相同，一样，一致","explanation":"같다：相同，一样，一致；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"1","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"31523","definition":"数数时第一个数目。","pronunciation":["일"]},{"id":"e23df8834a583975","term":"년","zh":"年","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3","entryId":"26823","definition":"计算年度的数量单位。","pronunciation":["년"]},{"id":"d1877a494d990fd1","term":"후배","zh":"学弟，学妹，师弟，师妹，后辈","audio":"/audio/d1877a494d990fd1bd03.mp3","entryId":"73247","definition":"同一学校内比自己入学晚的人。","pronunciation":["후ː배"]},{"id":"9584bdb8265fdb6c","term":"나이","zh":"年龄，年纪，岁数","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3","entryId":"60486","definition":"人或动植物等来到世上生存至今的年数。","pronunciation":["나이"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相同，一样，一致","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"彼此并无差异。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8ed9c7a423796584c8b9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37903-2-8-2","ko":"응, 고등학교를 일 년 꿇었다더라.","zh":"嗯，听说他高中留过一级。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고등학교를","meaning":"高中","explanation":"고등학교：高中；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"고등학교","audio":"/audio/1920aafc68961592e642.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23380","senseId":"1","lemma":"고등학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일","meaning":"一","explanation":"일：一","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31523","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"년","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꿇었다더라.","meaning":"留级","explanation":"꿇다：留级；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다더라：把以前听说的情况告诉对方，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"꿇다","audio":"/audio/965ffbac41207b58d4e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37903","senseId":"2","lemma":"꿇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1920aafc68961592","term":"고등학교","zh":"高中","audio":"/audio/1920aafc68961592e642.mp3","entryId":"23380","definition":"具有初中毕业水平的学历或初中毕业后可以去的学校。","pronunciation":["고등학꾜"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"31523","definition":"数数时第一个数目。","pronunciation":["일"]},{"id":"e23df8834a583975","term":"년","zh":"年","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3","entryId":"26823","definition":"计算年度的数量单位。","pronunciation":["년"]},{"id":"965ffbac41207b58","term":"꿇다","zh":"留级","audio":"/audio/965ffbac41207b58d4e5.mp3","entryId":"37903","definition":"在学校，学生未能及时升到高一年级。","pronunciation":["꿀타"]}],"audio":"/audio/5992e5822d260701d43b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.138,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37903","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":72,"sequenceScore":1.9647,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["敏俊比我们低一届，不过听说年龄一样。","嗯，听说他高中留过一级。","你现在是要跟我打架吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["敏俊比我们低一届，不过听说年龄一样。","嗯，听说他高中留过一级。","你现在是要跟我打架吗？"],"answer":1}]}
